SUMMARY:Lectio Terra: Cucurbits
DESCRIPTION:With Marge Piercy\, Padraig Regan.\n\nTo untangle the messy wor
 ld of squashes and melons\, I will be spending the next three weeks zoomin
 g in on some of our favorite summer delectations\, moving from the broad g
 ourd family (Cucurbitaceae) to the distinctive melon-and-cucumber genus (C
 ucumis) and\, finally\, to the wholly separate watermelon species (Citrull
 us lanatus).\n\nRead the essay: https://earthlyhours.com/lectio-terra/cucu
 rbits/
