DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:Lectio Terra: Ghost Pipe
DESCRIPTION:With Emily Dickinson\, Merlin Sheldrake.\n\nI felt nearly oblig
 ated\, given the time of year\, to dedicate this week’s entry to the ven
 erable pumpkin\, that special gourd so eternally loved and multifariously 
 depicted by Yayoi Kusama (may she rest in peace). But in the spirit of vee
 ring\, I present instead a more mysterious offering: a non-photosynthesizi
 ng parasite nonetheless described by Emily Dickinson as “the preferred f
 lower of life.”\n\nRead the essay: https://earthlyhours.com/lectio-terra
 /ghost-pipe/
URL:https://earthlyhours.com/lectio-terra/ghost-pipe/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
